; Room 40 ($28): Dr Jones will never believe this
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: blue (1). Conveyor: moves Willy left, 32 cells from row 15 column 0.
; Ramp: 5 cells from row 10 column 24 up to row 6 column 20, rising to the
; left.
; .
; Items (from the item table at #R$A400): 1, at row 7 column 19.
; .
; Exits: left Room 41 (The Attic, #R$E900); right Room 39 (Emergency
; Generator, #R$E700); up Room 16 (We must perform a Quirkafleeg, #R$D000);
; down Room 0 (The Off Licence, #R$C000). Odd: the down exit of Room 16 is
; Room 0, not this room.
; .
; Entities: slot 0: definition $1B (at $A0D8) start $92; slot 1: definition
; $0B (at $A058) start $0A. List ends at slot 2 ($FF).
